{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月13日、5thシングル「君の名は希望」発売されましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お陰様で、デイリーチャートで１位を頂くことができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の季節にぴったりの曲なので、是非ともたくさんの方に聴いて貰って、皆さんのお気に入りの曲とかになるといいなぁって思ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップリングではシャキイズム！\n曲はもちろんですが、何よりMVを見てもらいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/03/15/3192025/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友人生駒と風紀委員生田。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は風紀委員と仲良し笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、後ろに彼女のサユリが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サユリとのラブラブ写真はまた後ほど載せます(〃▽〃)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはでこぴん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜のお姉さん5人で歌ってるのですが、歌詞を読むだけでキュンキュンする可愛らしい曲になっています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVは色々と合成したり、撮影が大変だったけど凄く可愛く仕上がったので私も大好きな作品！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いたり鼻水垂らしたりしたけど、全部全部良い思い出(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/03/15/3192025/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"微妙に眼鏡ずれてるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の曲はどれもお気に入りですッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどの曲が一番好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は握手会o(^▽^)o\nわくわく♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいでこぴんしてやるー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は、今、おでこにやけどの傷跡アリ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセでお待ちしてます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/03/15/3192025/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}